Built on the AlgoVoi substrate: RFC 8785 (JCS) canonicalisation + SHA-256. The
journal is a hash chain over content-addressed references, recomputable offline.
The commercial audit-chain is the same shape with durable, post-quantum-signed,
append-only storage.
